---
import DemoLayout from '../../../layouts/DemoLayout.astro'
const rooms=[{name:'Garden Suite',tag:'YOUR LITTLE SANCTUARY',price:1850000,size:'42 m²',img:'photo-1611892440504-42a792e24d32',desc:'Bangun perlahan, ditemani cahaya hangat dan hijau taman tropis.'},{name:'Pool Villa',tag:'A WORLD OF YOUR OWN',price:3200000,size:'86 m²',img:'photo-1571896349842-33c89424de2d',desc:'Kolam pribadi, teras lapang, dan waktu yang sepenuhnya milik Anda.'},{name:'Ocean Pavilion',tag:'FOLLOW THE HORIZON',price:4100000,size:'110 m²',img:'photo-1582719478250-c89cae4dc85b',desc:'Pemandangan laut lepas dari paviliun dengan sentuhan material lokal.'}]
---
<DemoLayout title="SÉLA — A slower kind of stay" slug="hotel" description="Demo boutique resort tropis dengan pilihan kamar dan simulasi ketersediaan reservasi.">
 <div class="sela"><header class="hotel-nav"><a href="#demo-main" class="logo">SÉLA<span>UBUD · BALI</span></a><nav aria-label="Navigasi Sela"><a href="#stay">The stay</a><a href="#experience">The experience</a><a href="#story">Our story</a></nav><a href="#booking" class="nav-book">Reserve your escape ↗</a></header><div>
 <section class="hotel-hero"><img class="hero-photo" src="/images/demo-assets/photo-1571896349842-33c89424de2d.webp" alt="Kolam renang resort tropis dengan pohon palem dan vila" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-content"><p class="kicker">SOMEWHERE BETWEEN STILLNESS & WONDER</p><h1>A slower<br/>kind of <em>stay.</em></h1><p>Di antara rimbun pohon dan hangat matahari Bali,<br/>temukan kembali nikmatnya tidak terburu-buru.</p><a href="#stay">Find your sanctuary <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>8°30′24.8″S 115°15′44.2″E</span><span>PAUSE. BREATHE. BELONG. ↓</span></div></section>
 <section id="booking" class="booking-wrap"><form id="booking-form" class="booking"><label>CHECK-IN<input id="checkin" name="checkin" type="date" required aria-label="Tanggal check-in"/></label><label>CHECK-OUT<input id="checkout" name="checkout" type="date" required aria-label="Tanggal check-out"/></label><label>YOUR COMPANY<select id="guests" name="guests"><option value="2">2 tamu</option><option value="1">1 tamu</option><option value="3">3 tamu</option><option value="4">4 tamu</option></select></label><button type="submit">Check availability <span>↗</span></button></form><p id="booking-error" role="status"></p></section>
 <section id="story" class="intro container"><p class="kicker">A LITTLE CLOSER TO YOURSELF</p><h2>Ruang untuk berhenti sejenak.<br/>Dan <em>merasa utuh kembali.</em></h2><p>Séla adalah jeda kecil dari dunia yang bergerak cepat. Sebuah rumah singgah dengan 18 kamar, keramahan yang tulus, dan alam yang selalu punya cara menyambut Anda.</p><div class="intro-note"><span>Locally rooted.</span><i>✳</i><span>Thoughtfully made.</span></div></section>
 <section id="stay" class="stays container"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="kicker">REST COMES NATURALLY</p><h2>Your private corner<br/>of <em>paradise.</em></h2></div><p>Tiga cara untuk merasa di rumah.<br/>Semuanya dengan ruang untuk bernapas.</p></div><div class="rooms">{rooms.map((room,index)=><article><div class="room-img"><img src={`/images/demo-assets/${room.img}.webp`} alt={room.name+' di Sela Resort'} loading="lazy"/><span>{room.size} · 2–4 guests</span></div><p class="kicker">{room.tag}</p><h3>{room.name}</h3><p class="room-desc">{room.desc}</p><div class="room-price"><p>Mulai <b>Rp {new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID').format(room.price)}</b><small> / malam</small></p><button data-room={index} aria-label={`Pilih ${room.name}`}>↗</button></div></article>)}</div></section>
 <section id="experience" class="experience"><div class="experience-photo"><img src="/images/demo-assets/photo-1540541338287-41700207dee6.webp" alt="Kolam dan kursi santai dengan pemandangan laut tropis" loading="lazy"/><span>THE ART OF DOING A LITTLE LESS</span></div><div class="experience-copy"><p class="kicker">THE DAYS ARE YOURS</p><h2>No agenda.<br/>Just <em>possibility.</em></h2><p>Isi hari dengan hal kecil yang membuat Anda merasa hidup. Atau biarkan hari berlalu dengan indah begitu saja.</p><div class="experience-item"><span>01</span><div><h3>Morning, mindfully</h3><p>Yoga saat matahari terbit, diiringi suara alam.</p></div></div><div class="experience-item"><span>02</span><div><h3>From our island, to your table</h3><p>Hidangan musiman dari kebun dan petani sekitar.</p></div></div><div class="experience-item"><span>03</span><div><h3>A ritual of renewal</h3><p>Perawatan spa dengan tradisi dan bahan alami Bali.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="quote container"><p class="kicker">WORDS FROM OUR GUEST BOOK · SAMPLE REVIEW</p><blockquote>“We came for a weekend.<br/>We found a feeling we wanted to keep.”</blockquote><p>Amelia & James · Melbourne</p><span>★★★★★</span></section>
 </div><footer><div class="container footer-inner"><a href="#demo-main" class="logo">SÉLA<span>UBUD · BALI</span></a><p>Come as you are.<br/>Leave a little lighter.</p><div><a href="#booking">Your next chapter starts here ↗</a><small>© 2026 Séla · Website & reservasi demo</small></div></div></footer>
 <dialog id="booking-dialog" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><button class="close" aria-label="Tutup reservasi">×</button><p class="kicker">YOUR SLOWER DAYS AWAIT</p><h2 id="booking-title">Rencanakan jeda Anda.</h2><p id="stay-summary"></p><div id="available-rooms">{rooms.map((room,index)=><button class="available-room" data-select-room={index}><span><strong>{room.name}</strong><small>{room.size} · Sarapan termasuk</small></span><b>Rp {new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID').format(room.price)}<small>/ malam</small></b></button>)}</div><div id="booking-total"></div><button id="confirm-booking" class="primary" disabled>Simulasikan reservasi</button><p id="booking-result" role="status">Demo saja. Tidak ada pembayaran atau reservasi nyata.</p></dialog>
 </div>
 <script define:vars={{rooms}}>
 const form=document.querySelector('#booking-form'), checkin=document.querySelector('#checkin'),checkout=document.querySelector('#checkout'),dialog=document.querySelector('#booking-dialog');let nights=1,selected=-1;const rupiah=value=>'Rp '+new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID').format(value);function localDate(d){return new Date(d.getTime()-d.getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,10)}const now=new Date();checkin.min=localDate(now);checkin.value=localDate(now);const next=new Date(now);next.setDate(next.getDate()+1);checkout.min=localDate(next);checkout.value=localDate(next);
 checkin.addEventListener('change',()=>{const day=new Date(checkin.value+'T12:00:00');day.setDate(day.getDate()+1);if(!Number.isNaN(day.getTime())){checkout.min=localDate(day);if(checkout.value<=checkin.value)checkout.value=localDate(day)}});
 function selectRoom(index){selected=index;document.querySelectorAll('[data-select-room]').forEach(button=>{const active=Number(button.dataset.selectRoom)===index;button.classList.toggle('selected',active);button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active))});const guests=Number(document.querySelector('#guests').value);const extra=guests>2?(guests-2)*350000*nights:0;document.querySelector('#booking-total').textContent=rupiah(rooms[index].price*nights+extra)+' / '+nights+' malam'+(extra?' · termasuk tambahan tamu':'')+' · pajak termasuk';document.querySelector('#confirm-booking').disabled=false;document.querySelector('#booking-result').textContent='Demo saja. Tidak ada pembayaran atau reservasi nyata.';}
 function showAvailability(index=-1){if(!form.reportValidity())return;const start=new Date(checkin.value+'T12:00:00'),end=new Date(checkout.value+'T12:00:00');nights=Math.round((end-start)/86400000);if(nights<1||nights>30){document.querySelector('#booking-error').textContent='Pilih check-out setelah check-in, maksimal 30 malam.';return}document.querySelector('#booking-error').textContent='';selected=-1;document.querySelector('#booking-total').textContent='Pilih kamar untuk melihat total menginap.';document.querySelector('#confirm-booking').disabled=true;document.querySelectorAll('[data-select-room]').forEach(b=>{b.classList.remove('selected');b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});document.querySelector('#stay-summary').textContent=start.toLocaleDateString('id-ID',{day:'numeric',month:'short'})+' – '+end.toLocaleDateString('id-ID',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'})+' · '+nights+' malam · '+document.querySelector('#guests').value+' tamu. Semua kamar tersedia pada simulasi ini.';document.querySelector('#booking-result').textContent='Demo saja. Tidak ada pembayaran atau reservasi nyata.';if(index>=0)selectRoom(index);dialog.showModal();}
 form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();showAvailability()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-room]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showAvailability(Number(b.dataset.room))));document.querySelectorAll('[data-select-room]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectRoom(Number(b.dataset.selectRoom))));dialog.querySelector('.close').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===dialog)dialog.close()});document.querySelector('#confirm-booking').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(selected<0)return;document.querySelector('#booking-result').textContent='✓ Simulasi berhasil — '+rooms[selected].name+' untuk '+nights+' malam. Tidak ada reservasi nyata atau biaya yang dikenakan.';document.querySelector('#confirm-booking').disabled=true});
 </script>
 <style>
 .sela{background:#f7f4ed;color:#343d33;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.container{max-width:1290px;margin:auto;padding-left:6%;padding-right:6%}.hotel-nav{height:100px;background:#f7f4ed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 6%}.logo{font:38px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:7px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.logo span{display:block;font:8px Arial;letter-spacing:3px;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}.hotel-nav nav{display:flex;gap:35px}.hotel-nav nav a{font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.nav-book{border:1px solid #a1a893;padding:14px 20px;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;color:inherit}.hotel-hero{position:relative;height:650px;background:#3c5143;color:#fff;overflow:hidden}.hero-photo{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(.66)}.hero-content{position:absolute;top:80px;left:9%}.kicker{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1.7}.hero-content h1{font:clamp(70px,7.8vw,112px)/.98 Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:30px 0}.hero-content em{font-weight:400;color:#efdfbc}.hero-content>p:not(.kicker){font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#f4f1e8}.hero-content>a{display:inline-flex;gap:40px;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff73;padding:18px 0;font-size:12px;margin-top:15px}.hero-bottom{position:absolute;bottom:35px;left:6%;right:6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:2px}.booking-wrap{max-width:1135px;margin:-1px auto 0;padding:0 25px}.booking{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d5d6c8;gap:24px}.booking label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.6px;border-right:1px solid #d5d6c8}.booking input,.booking select{display:block;border:0;background:transparent;font:14px Arial;color:#343d33;padding:10px 8px 0 0;width:95%;color-scheme:light}.booking button,.primary{background:#536047;color:white;border:0;padding:15px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.booking button span{margin-left:20px}#booking-error{font-size:12px;color:#a54232}.intro{text-align:center;padding-top:90px;padding-bottom:90px}.intro h2{font:46px/1.22 Georgia;margin:25px 0;letter-spacing:-1px}h2 em{color:#7d836a;font-weight:400}.intro>p:not(.kicker){max-width:560px;margin:auto;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#65695d}.intro-note{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:20px;font:italic 15px Georgia;margin-top:30px}.intro-note i{font-size:25px;font-style:normal;color:#a0a384}.section-top{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:35px}.section-top h2{font:44px/1.15 Georgia;margin:15px 0 0}.section-top>p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#65695d}.rooms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:27px}.room-img{height:330px;position:relative;background:#b6baa2}.room-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.room-img span{position:absolute;left:15px;bottom:15px;background:#f7f4edec;font-size:9px;padding:9px 12px}.rooms article>.kicker{color:#686b5d;margin-top:24px;font-size:8px}.rooms h3{font:29px Georgia;margin:10px 0}.room-desc{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#65695d;min-height:45px}.room-price{border-top:1px solid #d6d8cc;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.room-price p{font-size:10px;color:#666c5d}.room-price b{font-size:12px;color:#343d33;font-weight:400}.room-price small{font-size:9px}.room-price button{border:1px solid #b8bdac;background:transparent;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer}.stays{padding-bottom:95px}.experience{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:#e9eddf}.experience-photo{min-height:630px;position:relative;background:#687e6a}.experience-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;object-fit:cover}.experience-photo>span{position:absolute;bottom:35px;left:40px;color:white;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px}.experience-copy{padding:65px 12%}.experience-copy h2{font:52px/1.1 Georgia;margin:20px 0}.experience-copy>p:not(.kicker){font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#65695d;margin-bottom:30px}.experience-item{display:flex;gap:25px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #c7ceba}.experience-item>span{font:italic 15px Georgia;color:#606752}.experience-item h3{font:19px Georgia;margin:0 0 7px}.experience-item p{font-size:11px;color:#65695d;line-height:1.6}.quote{text-align:center;padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px}.quote blockquote{font:italic 34px/1.5 Georgia;margin:25px 0}.quote>p:not(.kicker){font-size:10px;color:#65695d}.quote>span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#9b916a;display:block;margin-top:15px}footer{background:#333f34;color:#eeeee1;padding:45px 0}.footer-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.footer-inner>p{font:italic 22px/1.5 Georgia}.footer-inner>div>a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font:16px Georgia;border-bottom:1px solid #9ba18a;padding-bottom:10px}.footer-inner small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#b1b8a3;margin-top:25px}dialog{width:calc(100% - 32px);max-width:580px;max-height:90dvh;padding:36px;border:0;background:#f7f4ed;color:#343d33}dialog::backdrop{background:#19281bbb}dialog h2{font:32px Georgia;margin:20px 0}.close{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;width:32px;height:32px;border:0;background:#e9eddf;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}#stay-summary{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.available-room{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:18px;border:1px solid #d2d7c5;background:transparent;margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer;color:inherit}.available-room.selected{border-color:#536047;background:#e9eddf;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #536047}.available-room strong{font:18px Georgia}.available-room b{font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.available-room small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#65695d;margin-top:7px}#booking-total{padding:20px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.primary{width:100%}.primary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}#booking-result{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:15px}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b5a879;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.hotel-nav nav{display:none}.hotel-hero{height:600px}.hero-content{left:7%;top:65px}.hero-content h1{font-size:90px}.booking{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.booking label:nth-child(2){border:0}.intro{padding-top:65px;padding-bottom:65px}.intro h2{font-size:38px}.rooms{gap:18px}.room-img{height:260px}.room-price{align-items:start}.room-price p{line-height:1.8}.room-price b{display:block}.experience{grid-template-columns:1fr}.experience-photo{min-height:380px}.experience-copy{padding:50px 8%}.footer-inner{flex-wrap:wrap}.footer-inner>div{width:100%}}@media(max-width:560px){.hotel-nav{height:82px}.logo{font-size:30px}.nav-book{font-size:10px;padding:12px}.hero-content h1{font-size:78px}.hero-content .kicker{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.hotel-hero{height:590px}.hero-bottom span:first-child{display:none}.hero-content>p:not(.kicker){font-size:12px}.booking{gap:20px 12px}.booking input,.booking select{font-size:12px}.booking button{font-size:11px}.booking button span{margin-left:7px}.intro h2{font-size:31px}.intro>p:not(.kicker){font-size:12px}.section-top{display:block}.section-top h2{font-size:38px}.section-top>p{margin-top:20px}.rooms{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}.room-img{height:340px}.room-desc{min-height:0}.room-price b{display:inline}.stays{padding-bottom:55px}.experience-copy h2{font-size:45px}.quote blockquote{font-size:25px}.quote{padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:55px}.footer-inner>p{font-size:19px}dialog{padding:30px 22px}.available-room{padding:14px}.available-room strong{font-size:16px}}
 </style>
</DemoLayout>
